define user ask general question
  "Who invented chess?"
  "What is the best way to heat food?"

define user ask car related question
  "Tell me about the new model"
  "What is the new model"
  "What engine does it have?"
  "What are the key features"
  "Tell me about the interior"
  "What choices do I have for the seats?"

define user ask capabilities
  "What can you do?"
  "What can you help me with?"
  "tell me what you can do"
  "tell me about you"

define flow
  user ask general question
  bot respond to general question

define flow
  user ask car related question
  bot provide information

define flow
  user ask capabilities
  bot inform capabilities

define bot inform capabilities
  "As an AI bot, I can provide you with a wide range of services, such as answering your queries, offering guidance, and providing relevant information about Land Rover vehicles. I can also help you with booking a test drive or scheduling a service appointment at your nearest Land Rover dealer. "
